#. +> trunk
#: singlefileresourcebase.cpp:230
#, kde-format
msgid "The file '%1' was changed on disk while there were still pending changes in Akonadi. To avoid data loss, a backup of the internal changes has been created at '%2'."
msgstr "De Datei \"%1\" wöör op de Fastplaat ännert, bides stunnen binnen Akonadi ok noch Ännern ut. Dormit keen Daten wegkaamt, hett Akonadi en Kopie mit sien intern Ännern as \"%2\" sekert."

#. +> trunk
#: singlefileresourcebase.cpp:252
#, kde-format
